luam-bounty-name-distress-beacon = distress beacon
luam-bounty-name-solo-report = completed solo report
luam-bounty-name-black-box = recovered black box or black box report
luam-bounty-name-repair-tool = repair tool
luam-bounty-name-navigation-gps = navigation GPS
luam-bounty-name-navigation-comms = handicomms or radio relay tool

luam-bounty-desc-distress-closure = A silent distress marker needs closure. Send one marked beacon and one written report. A lone contractor can complete this without a living client.
luam-bounty-desc-black-box = Archive a recovered recorder or black box report with a second written closure report. Coordinates, cargo status, or probable cause are enough for payment.
luam-bounty-desc-field-repair = A low-pop outpost needs proof that repair support is ready. Send two field repair tools and one solo report describing the repaired or surveyed fault.
luam-bounty-desc-navigation = The sector needs a recoverable route package. Send one GPS, one handicomms or radio relay tool, and one solo report with coordinates, signal quality, or route notes.
